_:n6a5482b0be8542ed98b25705ddbd4321b34 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#contains> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an Impact Chain model to its factors and connections."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#high> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "High confidence level. This refers to robust evidence, which includes data from official entities, scientific articles, books, and multiple credible sources."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#VulnerabilityFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "INFORM.MOVE Framework (https://drmkc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/inform-index/INFORM-Risk/Methodology - Birkmann et al., 2013) (both for risk assessment but incl. Classification of vulnerability components)."@en .
