<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#AdaptationFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Measure to decrease the negative consequences of an impact by addressing one or more vulnerabilities or impacting mechanisms."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the confidence level of an Impact Chain factor or connection."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ExposureFactor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
